   | |       /_______________   _________|                  |X|

S - Save Point   X - Inaccessible   C - Chest you can&#x27;t get yet</pre>
      </AsciiMap>

      <p>There&#x27;s no new treasure to find, so just head straight to your destinations. Head west and you&#x27;ll find that the bridge has been fixed. If you continue west you&#x27;ll find that you can&#x27;t go to <Tag type="place">Alma Mine</Tag> in this time period, so just go south to the <Tag type="place">Woodland Path</Tag>. Go west and south to reach <Tag type="place">Judgement Cliff</Tag>.</p>

      <Callout type="node" title="Historia Milestone: The Road to Sand Fortress">
        <p>Cross <Tag type="place">Judgement Cliff</Tag> to reach the <Tag type="place">Sand Fortress</Tag>.</p>
      </Callout>
    </div>
  </ChapterCard>

  <!-- Chapter 15 -->
  <ChapterCard
    id="ch15"
    number={15}
    title="Judgement Cliff (Alternate Chapter 1)"
    timeline="Alternate"
  >
    <TacticalBriefing
      level="18"
      party="Stocke, Raynie, Rosch"
