        { name: "Blue Flame", weakness: "Ice" },
        { name: "Flame Lizard", weakness: "Ice" },
        { name: "Poison Crab" },
        { name: "Sand Hunter", weakness: "Sleep" },
        { name: "Sand Worm", weakness: "Ice" },
        { name: "Storm" }
      ]}
    />

    <div class="chapter-walkthrough-prose">
      <p><Tag type="place">Judgement Cliff</Tag> is relatively unchanged since you were here last. The falling rocks can be avoided by simply watching the shadows and running across. However, when you reach the northern exit, you&#x27;ll be ambushed by an assassin.</p>

      <BossCard
        name="Shadow"
        weakness="None"
      >
        <p><strong>Strategy:</strong> <Tag type="char">Marco</Tag> shouldn&#x27;t be here, so you won&#x27;t have <Tag type="skill">Magic Boost</Tag>. Have <Tag type="char">Stocke</Tag> push the <Tag type="enemy">Shadow</Tag> to the back, while <Tag type="char">Raynie</Tag> uses <Tag type="skill">Fire</Tag> or <Tag type="skill">G-Fire</Tag>. If <Tag type="char">Rosch</Tag> has learned <Tag type="skill">Cross Spike</Tag>, use it to rack up heavy damage. Keep Stocke on healing duty if HP falls below 120.</p>
      </BossCard>

      <p>Continue through the north path to reach <Tag type="place">Sand Fortress</Tag>.</p>
    </div>
  </ChapterCard>

